    {
      "target": "광화문 앞에서 세종대왕 동상을 봤어요.",
      "reading": "gwanghwamun apeseo sejongdaewang dongsangeul bwasseoyo.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "I saw the King Sejong statue in front of Gwanghwamun.",
        "ko": "광화문 앞에서 세종대왕 동상을 봤어요.",
        "ipa": "gwanghwamun apeseo sejongdaewang dongsangeul bwasseoyo.",
        "ar": "رأيت تمثال الملك سيجونغ أمام غوانغهوامون.",
        "cs": "Před Kwanghwamun jsem viděl sochu krále Sejonga.",
